  - chromosome
  - replicon classification
  - machine learning
abstract: >-
  MobiOrigin is a CPU-oriented sequence-and-marker classifier that assigns
  bacterial DNA fragments to chromosome, plasmid, phage, or an explicit
  unclassified state. Version 0.1.1 packages the frozen three-seed dev1 model,
  independent biological annotation, and publication evidence from prospective
  and operational external comparisons.
